let __v_1144 = Value::from("From the main station to the centre a taxi is usually 15 to 25 euros in a European city and 5 to 15 in a smaller town, and the official rank outside the main exit charges the meter or the fixed fare: check the posted figure or the app price before you get in. The metro, tram or express bus is 2 to 5 euros for the same trip, so take that with a case you can wheel and keep the taxi for a late arrival or a lot of luggage.");
